        "id": 1989932
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-07T23:18:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can get app id from package name by `adb shell dumpsys package \u003cpackage_name\u003e | grep appId`. It seems not too much a hassle to me. What are your use cases for dumping and how do you do it currently?",
      "parentUuid": "d5de67fe_1aaaa76c",
      "revId": "c98dfc3127139b740f4533d99c281b90c591e999",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
